	d(h,0) = g	d(h,1) = d



Reduced Deterministic Finite Automaton is:

	(Q,S,delta,q0,F)

where:

	Q = {ag,bf,ce,d}
	S = {0,1}
	F = {d}
	Start state is ag
	Delta: 
	d(ag,0) = bf	d(ag,1) = ag
	d(bf,0) = ag	d(bf,1) = ce
	d(ce,0) = d	d(ce,1) = bf
	d(d,0) = d	d(d,1) = ag
